# Disease six: Core character dependent

In the park, Li Chi Minh is the core asset. In the sound, the core is Seo-tao. In most head podcasts, "people" is all.

** This means**: The value of the podcast company is highly concentrated on a few individuals, and the value of the person leaving is down. This is a general problem in the MAC industry, but it is particularly pronounced in the area of podcasts - because the podcasts have a deeper "personal trust" than the video (you listen to a person in your ear for 30 minutes a day, and you have a much closer relationship than a short video).

